    <string name="app_restricted">Some vendors (like Oneplus) restrict app background activity to optimize their battery.
        "\nThis makes AutoDark Redux can not wake up in time and switch dark mode for you. Please refer to <a href='https://dontkillmyapp.com/'>dontkillmyapp.com</a> for solution."
        "\nAlso, if you are using some kind of optimizer/battery saver app, please add AutoDark Redux to their white list."
        "\nDon\'t worry about the battery, AutoDark Redux uses alarm to work, see also: developer.android.com/reference/android/app/AlarmManager."
    </string>
